s shouldn't be merged until we have this feature ready to merge for other platforms that support HDR output.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115666#pullrequestreview-4008013991","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115666","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2026-03-25T16:16:02Z"}]